==Behind the scenes==
[[Star Wars Helmet Collection 76|''Star Wars Helmet Collection'' 76]] stated that [[Aurra Sing]] was a [[near-human]] hybrid,<ref name="HC 76">{{HelmetCollectionCite|76|Weapons & Uniforms}}</ref> however, this was later changed with the identification of the [[Palliduvan]] species in ''[[Star Wars Resistance]]'' and Sing was confirmed to be a member of that species.<ref name="Bucket's List">{{BucketsList|aL8Jriu0JdM|#1.15: "The Doza Dilemma"|sw_url=video/buckets-list-the-doza-dilemma-star-wars-resistance}}</ref>

